{"id":471,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Glaceon is able to lower its body temperature very quickly. It freezes the atmosphere, creating diamond dust that glitters like gems while it flutters and dances around."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The coldness emanating from Glaceon causes powdery snow to form, making it quite a popular Pokémon at ski resorts."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Any who become captivated by the beauty of the snowfall that Glaceon creates will be frozen before they know it."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It can instantaneously freeze any moisture that’s around it, creating ice pellets to shoot at its prey."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It protects itself by freezing its fur into sharp needles. It can drop its body temperature below –75 degrees Fahrenheit."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It freezes its fur into icicles, spiky and sharp, and tackles its prey."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can control its body temperature at will. This enables it to freeze the moisture in the atmosphere, creating flurries of diamond dust."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It causes small ice crystals to form by lowering the temperature of the surrounding atmosphere."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Snow Cloak","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's evasiveness in snow."},{"name":"Ice Body","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon gradually regains HP in snow."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":35,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","